SpikerBot forward, and speaks an affirmative \u2018Mhmm!\u2019 As it gets into the groove.","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775580545658","neuronKeys":["[#649b2]"],"edgeStrings":["[#649b2]_#_[#326e3]","[#649b2]_#_[#f3f93]","[#649b2]_#_[#2301b]"],"description":"Pressing down will spin SpikerBot to reorient it for the next dance moves!","thumbnail":""},{"id":"1775580646552","neuronKeys":["[#4cfb2]","[#78b71]","[#dddca]","[#0d51b]","[#c760b]","[#08ee4]","[#a8790]","[#d71ea]","[#dd652]","[#5342f]"],"edgeStrings":["[#4cfb2]_#_[#78b71]","[#78b71]_#_[#4cfb2]","[#78b71]_#_[#dddca]","[#dddca]_#_[#0d51b]","[#0d51b]_#_[#4cfb2]","[#0d51b]_#_[#78b71]","[#c760b]_#_[#0d51b]","[#dddca]_#_[#c760b]","[#a8790]_#_[#08ee4]","[#08ee4]_#_[#a8790]","[#d71ea]_#_[#08ee4]","[#d71ea]_#_[#a8790]","[#5342f]_#_[#d71ea]","[#dd652]_#_[#d71ea]","[#5342f]_#_[#dd652]","[#a8790]_#_[#5342f]"],"description":"Can you imagine any other dance moves that spikerBot can do using other buttons, or executing other patterns? What will happen when we make multiple dance moves happen at once?","thumbnail":""}],"info":{"title":"Remote Control Dancer","description":"Slide to the left, slide to the right, spin and more all with remote control!","author":"User","version":"1.0.1","timestamp":"2026-04-08T16:03:04.174922"}}